# The deployment builds the web console: the frontend, with the Python package
# from backend/ bundled into it for the in-browser engine, and the documents
# from docs/. Nothing else is needed on the build machine.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading slash. Without it a pattern matches
# a directory of that name at ANY depth - "data/" once stripped
# backend/kerbside/data/, the renderer, and the deployed site failed at import.
/.venv/
/tests/
/data/
/frontend/node_modules/
/frontend/dist/
/frontend/dist-web/
/.claude/
**/__pycache__/
